.. This is the era where humans and gods are destined to part ways.\n\n\n\nFujimaru and Mash, the pair who have fought through all six previous Singularities, embark on their final battle.\n\n\n\n(Source: Aniplex of America)\n\n\n\nNote: Based on the seventh chapter of the first arc in Fate/Grand Order, a Japanese smartphone role-playing game from TYPE-MOON’s Fate franchise."],"ja":["Fate/Grand Order -絶対魔獣戦線バビロニア-",""]},"relations":[{"id":38086,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":40206,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":41497,"relation":"sequel"}],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-19075":"2023-11-20T22:49:41Z","serial-49151":"2023-02-26T08:21:02Z","serial-18903":"2020-03-23T08:51:30Z","serial-19022":"2020-09-09T14:13:45Z"},"kodikIds":["serial-19075","serial-49151","serial-18903","serial-19022"],"relatedMalIds":[38086,40206,41497],"availableEpisodeCount":22}]}